  "hints": [
    "Postgres: `EXTRACT(ISODOW FROM ordered_at)` is 6 for Saturday and 7 for Sunday. (MySQL has DAYOFWEEK, which numbers days differently.)",
    "Late means `delivered_at > ordered_at + INTERVAL '45 minutes'`, a strict comparison.",
    "Use `100.0 *` before dividing, so the division isn't integer division."
  ],
