  "sampleDataSql": "INSERT INTO food_orders (order_id, zone, ordered_at, delivered_at) VALUES\n  (1, 'Andheri', '2026-05-02 20:00', '2026-05-02 20:50'),\n  (2, 'Andheri', '2026-05-03 13:00', '2026-05-03 13:30'),\n  (3, 'Andheri', '2026-05-04 13:00', '2026-05-04 14:30'),\n  (4, 'Bandra', '2026-05-02 21:00', '2026-05-02 21:45'),\n  (5, 'Bandra', '2026-05-03 22:00', NULL);",
  "schemaSql": "CREATE TABLE food_orders (\n  order_id INT PRIMARY KEY,\n  zone TEXT NOT NULL,\n  ordered_at TIMESTAMP NOT NULL,\n  delivered_at TIMESTAMP -- NULL if never delivered\n);",
  "statement": "An order counts as **late** if it was delivered **more than 45 minutes** after it was placed. Exactly 45 minutes is on time.\n\nFor orders **placed** on a Saturday or Sunday that were delivered (`delivered_at` is not NULL), report per zone:\n\n- `weekend_deliveries`: the number of such orders\n- `late_deliveries`: how many of them were late\n- `late_pct`: late as a percentage of weekend deliveries, rounded to 1 decimal place\n\nInclude only zones with at least one weekend delivery, ordered by `zone`.",
